OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day for most
OL,6,Fwith, especially in the east, patchy
OL,7,Flight drizzle. The best of any
OL,8,Fbrighter or sunnier spells expected
OL,9,Facross Dumfries and Galloway. Mainly
OL,10,Flight easterly or southeasterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA few clearer spells in the
OL,13,Fwest this evening, but generally a
OL,14,Fcloudy night with patchy light rain
OL,15,Fdeveloping through the early hours.
OL,16,FLight winds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FA largely cloudy day with
OL,19,Foutbreaks of mainly light rain and
OL,20,Fdrizzle slowly dying out. Winds
OL,21,Fremaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
